[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) which secures the door check strap (1b) to\nthe door pillar and close the door to push the check strap back\nin.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Rear coupling for /front door. driver&#x27;s side</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428316\">D30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Front passenger door/ rear coupling.</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428321\">D31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the hinge bolts.</p><p>4. Lift the doodr and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045361.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the door on the hinges.</p><p>Tighten the hinge bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>SIDE DOORS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Check the various appliances on the door\nare working properly.</p><p>Make the check strap come out and tighten\nthe bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Check the door alignment and, if necessary, \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2429478\">7005A14</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]